{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T14:28:10.100Z","author":"pi-glm-tooling","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"f97248eb555a999d6e67e9b1","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-12T14:28:10.100Z","author":"pi-glm-tooling","text":"Packed-consumer acceptance (pm package install of the built tarball into npm and Bun consumers) surfaced three real-host contract gaps in the lint command registration; precise diagnosis and fixes are recorded under follow-up task pm-lint-1c6j: manifest schema capability, FlagDefinition.long without the value placeholder (list/value_name for repeatables), and omitting exit_code 0 from the command result. test/install.acceptance.ts encodes these contracts and will pass once they land."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T14:28:10.100Z"}],"before_hash":"ae995f891441c8fffef442e6a35cf85c24ec1b1ccd13c28d1ea25de3b399c690","after_hash":"1896da93d2e4a9abc4449bd6c7db49ff29514ddae752996c6a72a60542f808a6","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"03e3e9f358f5388d96f79940538c1fe4c8021431ce0342b658dd4a0bf907d8c8"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T14:28:45.699Z","author":"codex-sol","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"eea1efbfed9603302cd01e6d","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-12T14:28:45.699Z","author":"codex-sol","text":"SDK authoring gaps: registered flags need separate long names and value_name; long strings containing value placeholders can appear in help yet be rejected during invocation. Typed flags require manifest schema capability. Explicit handler exit_code 0 is rejected; the adapter uses SDK printResult and suppressHostOutput, with host exit control only for nonzero verdicts. Rendered receipts still carry exit_code 0 or 1."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T14:28:45.699Z"}],"before_hash":"1896da93d2e4a9abc4449bd6c7db49ff29514ddae752996c6a72a60542f808a6","after_hash":"8838776fec3b2fb7a1b3b0deb98b2f972fd9db6845606b9c7e5bb7542b0832d5","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"f28bc01ba421f7c172fb8d248fe052a140e6b18f6bee52d8d9efcf6c7275e0e7"}
